  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have tested with a small animator controller. This layer has two states, the first one (`0`) has a parameter driver that writes `1` to the parameter `LocalParam` and it will transition to the second state (`1`) when `LocalParam` is modified. Therefore, the transition should occur finally. However, the transition will not occur.\nThere are duplicated parameters `TrackingType` in this controller. It seems that they are preventing parameter drivers from working. When I removed one of them, this controller worked as I expected.\nIt is a bit hard to add duplicated parameters to an animator controller, but it is not impossible. Could you fix the Parameter Driver to work or validate controllers before uploading?\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Q6p3VyFmxC6oKsfDCROTpvE29gW0sjul/view?usp=sharing",
